{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "rule": "Every reachable route, tab, sheet, menu, form, dialog, toast, banner and shell piece of the web PWA has one entry. scripts/check-design-system.mjs fails when a route file or a file that opens a surface is missing here, or when a raw design value appears outside the exceptions below.",
